Ward knowledge base (packages/core/data)
========================================

index.json is adapted from the OWASP Mobile Application Security (MAS)
project and is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0); see LICENSE in this folder.
Ward's code is MIT; this data folder is not, and can't be relicensed.

Sources, each at a pinned release:
- OWASP MASVS v2.1.0, commit 8e133d09f4140518ed04cc254b18be9ff4990ffc
  https://github.com/OWASP/masvs/tree/v2.1.0 (controls/)
- OWASP MASWE v1.0.0, commit 308b82b4bbe29166934fb5a621b40471cfea61db
  https://github.com/OWASP/maswe/tree/v1.0.0 (weaknesses/)
- OWASP MASTG v2.0.0, commit 990472dbcffe126f5556045d60270c4ffdfdde72
  https://github.com/OWASP/mastg/tree/v2.0.0 (tests-beta/android,
  tests/android, demos/android)

