Changes made by Ward:
- Android records only; iOS records left out.
- Front matter reshaped into fields and links between records. Six links
  between tests and weaknesses were set by hand; each is listed with its
  reason under "overrides" in index.json.
- Text split into chunks at its "##" headings, long sections at blank
  lines. Deprecated MASTG v1 tests and placeholders are reduced to a short
  summary (title, replacements or note).
- Every record and chunk keeps the URL of its source file at the pinned
  tag, the version and the licence. Citations shown by Ward link there.
